{"pin":"AB06211","subcodes":[{"code":"AB06211","anchor":"","first_line":"Make firm our steps, O Lord! In thy path and strengthen Thou our hearts in Thine obedience… Reveal then Thyself, O Lord, by Thy merciful utterance","first_line_orig":"ای رب ثبت اقدامنا علی صراطک و قو قلوبنا علی طاعتک و وجه وجوهنا لجمال رحمانیتک  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"130","full_text_parts":["Make firm our steps, O Lord, in Thy path and strengthen Thou our hearts in Thine obedience.  Turn our faces toward the beauty of Thy oneness, and gladden our bosoms with the signs of Thy divine unity. Adorn our bodies with the robe of Thy bounty, and remove from our eyes the veil of sinfulness, and give us the chalice of Thy grace; that the essence of all beings may sing Thy praise before the vision of Thy grandeur.  Reveal then Thyself, O Lord, by Thy merciful utterance and the mystery of Thy divine being, that the holy ecstasy of prayer may fill our souls—a prayer that shall rise above words and letters and transcend the murmur of syllables and sounds—that all things may be merged into nothingness before the revelation of Thy splendor.\nLord!  These are servants that have remained fast and firm in Thy Covenant and Thy Testament, that","have held fast unto the cord of constancy in Thy Cause and clung unto the hem of the robe of Thy grandeur.  Assist them, O Lord, with Thy grace, confirm them with Thy power and strengthen their loins in obedience to Thee.\nThou art the Pardoner, the Gracious."],"translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA59:027a","source":"INBA59","locator":"027a","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v059/?page=29"},{"kind":"music","code":"J. Crone","source":"J","locator":"Crone","url":"https://youtu.be/YCzrt5UiiQc"},{"kind":"music","code":"L. Slott","source":"L","locator":"Slott","url":"https://lukeslott.bandcamp.com/track/reveal-thyself"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH2.044","source":"ADH2","locator":"044","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/i/ishraq-khavari_adhkar_muqarrabin_2.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH2_1#22 p.038","source":"ADH2_1#22 p.038","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/i/ishraq-khavari_adhkar_muqarrabin_2.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BCH.183","source":"BCH","locator":"183","url":"https://adibmasumian.files.wordpress.com/2021/02/bch.pdf#page=180"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BSHN.140.323","source":"BSHN","locator":"140.323","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/BN/bn-330.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BSHN.144.321","source":"BSHN","locator":"144.321"},{"kind":"publication","code":"KNSA.246-247 (459)","source":"KNSA","locator":"246-247 (459)","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/329.pdf#page=250"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MAS5.143","source":"MAS5","locator":"143","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MAS5/mas5-143.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MHT1a.046","source":"MHT1a.046","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/183.pdf#page=47"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MHT1b.004","source":"MHT1b.004","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/185.pdf#page=4"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MILAN.208","source":"MILAN","locator":"208","url":"https://www.h-net.org/~bahai/areprint/ab/M-R/M/milani/208.jpg"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MJH.059","source":"MJH","locator":"059","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMAI/mmai-60.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MJMJ1.008","source":"MJMJ1","locator":"008"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMG2#105 p.118","source":"MMG2","locator":"105 p.118","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMA/mma-121.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"NSR_1978.117","source":"NSR_1978","locator":"117"},{"kind":"publication","code":"NSR_1993.130","source":"NSR_1993","locator":"130","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/NR1/nr1-128.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BP1926.022","source":"BP1926","locator":"022"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BPRY.069-070","source":"BPRY","locator":"069-070","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/918651705"},{"ki